[{"title":"咏史 周瑜","author":"陈普","text":"乌林侥倖数帆风，便傍吴船向蜀中。\n刘葛关张无寸土，肯容公瑾擅江东。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7309,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 庞士元","author":"陈普","text":"放虎山林计已非，蛟龙云雨意犹迟。\n士元骥足思腾踏，盍在刘琮不告时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7310,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 房玄龄","author":"陈普","text":"周公制礼凤凰鸣，渠肯抽戈指建成。\n李绩牛山犹雨露，玄龄夜气失澄清。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7311,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 明帝","author":"陈普","text":"高堂光禄心刘向，未托孤前亦已知。\n争奈九龙规太大，不堪浅薄武皇基。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7312,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 明帝","author":"陈普","text":"咸通昏主如桀纣，青龙英君翻不如。\n关雎螽斯浑未识，鹊巢那得不鸠居。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7313,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 明帝","author":"陈普","text":"大和空国逐浮虚，曾为苍生一扫除。\n历数未容奸宄得，收曹卷马二中书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7314,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 明帝","author":"陈普